0 108.0 115.4 132.7 132.7 139.4 139.4 139.4 146.3 153.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"24.7 47.3 73.4 115.4 153.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » kabîlinden veliyyül'emir, veliyyünni'met, hâmî ve hafîz demek olur. Lâkin zâhir olan Melâikenin kelâmından olmasıdır. Cennet ile sevinecek ne var derseniz!<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"246\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 245.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 49.6 49.6 56.3 56.3 63.0 78.7 90.0 90.0 90.0 98.3 105.0 105.0 117.0 132.7 139.6 155.3 162.0 170.3 177.0 177.0 192.7 192.7 201.7 201.7 213.7 221.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.6 63.0 98.3 117.0 139.6 162.0 213.7 221.3 229.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> orada size canlarınız ne arzu ederse var<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"173\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 173.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 44.3 53.3 60.0 66.7 82.6 89.3 97.6 104.3 104.3 120.0 120.0 129.0 129.0 141.0 148.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 44.3 53.3 66.7 89.3 141.0 148.6 156.7\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hem orada size ne isterseniz var, ya'ni her neyi gelsin derseniz hemen gelir 32.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"59\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 59.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 21.0 28.4 28.4 36.0 36.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"><